{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_46789","headline":"谢秦府推官寄丹台集 · 齐己","name":"谢秦府推官寄丹台集","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"秦王手笔序丹台，不错褒扬最上才。\n凤阙几传爲匠硕，龙门曾用振风雷。\n钱郎未竭精华去，元白终存作者来。\n两轴蚌胎骊颔耀，枉临禅室伴寒灰。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"齐己","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_46789.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_46789","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"七言律诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}